exas\r\ndesk from ces\r\ntopic : ces deals summary\r\ndate : friday , january 21\r\ntime : 2 : 00 pm - 3 : 00 pm\r\nlocation : 3749\r\nplease e - mail me prior to friday with any specific questions that you may\r\nwant to address .\r\nthank you ,\r\nami\r\n3 - 9272',ham
