'Subject: march business - meter 6490 - help\r\nno deal for march or april 2000 . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . but i have flow . . . . . in\r\nmarch a total of 3804 flowed ( delivery ) and for april it \' s averaging about\r\n100 / day as a delivery . in february this was on the 213 contract , deal\r\n# 83088 as a receipt at this delivery meter . do we have a deal at this city\r\ngate to sell palacios this gas ?\r\nthanks ! ! !\r\ncharlotte',ham
