'Subject: note from ken seaman\r\nhi ,\r\n?\r\nhow is the family ? ? ? ? and the multiple jobs ? ? ? ? ? ?\r\n?\r\nwe just got back from omaha - - - linda \' s 40 th high school reunion . i wish\r\nsomeone would explain to me who all those old people were that attended .\r\n?\r\nputting $ 1 . 85 a gallon gas in that beast of hers was sure fun . i may need a\r\npart - time job if this keeps up long . ( just kidding - - you probably have\r\nenough to deal with - - right )\r\n?\r\njennifer has decided to journey off to law school at baylor . she and linda\r\nare going to waco friday to finalize an apartment .\r\nchris is managing the i - 10 texas land & cattle store . keeps him very busy .\r\n( can \' t even send an e - mail - - - - - like someone else i know ) ( just kidding )\r\n?\r\nwe are looking for property on a lake ( linda \' s request ) . like there is\r\nanything like that left in texas . we will probably drop in this house .\r\n?\r\npretty quiet here all things considered .\r\n?\r\ndrop me a line or give me a call when you have some time . or if you are\r\nreally free we could actually plan a lunch . the price of natural gas should\r\nhelp keep tom from hassling you too much .\r\n?\r\nken',ham
